Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Note: Syl Networking Standard Library v1.4
Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Note: Provides HTTP client and server primitives.
Note: HTTP requests use system curl via shell bridge.
Note: ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Note: ─── HTTP Client ──────────────────────────────────────────

Define an action called "fetch" taking url that does:
    Download url as response.
    Return response.

Define an action called "get" taking url that does:
    Download url as data.
    Return data.

Note: ─── HTTP Server ──────────────────────────────────────────

Define an action called "listen" taking port that does:
    Print "[ NET ] Listening on port " joined with port.

Note: ─── URL Utilities ────────────────────────────────────────

Define an action called "build_url" taking base and path that does:
    Set url to base joined with path.
    Return url.

Note: ─── Status Codes ─────────────────────────────────────────
Note: Common HTTP status codes for reference:
Note:   200 = OK
Note:   201 = Created
Note:   400 = Bad Request
Note:   401 = Unauthorized
Note:   403 = Forbidden
Note:   404 = Not Found
Note:   500 = Internal Server Error
